msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Did you know Gelateria Kamuro over on Taihei Boulevard is often packed with "
"businessmen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! That makes sense! The gelato there is sooo good! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Oh, you'd already heard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Kind of? I didn't know that businessmen were that into it. Are you a gelato "
"fan too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Somewhat. I go there every now and then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Huh... Hehehe. I'm just trying to imagine you eating gelato. It's such a "
"ridiculous mental image. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I heard the famous actor Noboru Kudarizaka likes to visit Sushi Gin on Showa"
" Street, completely incognito."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "No way! Kudarizaka goes there? He never told me that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Wait, you know him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm. We passed each other in a studio hallway once, back when I was on "
"TV."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Hold on a sec. Passing him in a hallway doesn't make him a friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Why would you say that!? He said hello to me too, you know! You'd better "
"apologize to me for being so mean, Kazuma Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"Ever heard of Kanrai over on Shichifuku Street? Well, their kimchi is "
"supposed to be made with authentic Korean pepper. It's apparently good for "
"you, due to the... something-cin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Yeah, Kanrai's kimchi is super good! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default> I'm a huge kimchi\r\n"
"fan. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Once I start chowing down on kimchi, I won't stop till it's\r\n"
"all gone! <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I always get kimchi, no matter where I go. Like, I always order octopus "
"kimchi when I go out drinking. Hehehe... I sound like an old man, don't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"I heard the ramen over at Kyushu No. 1 Star over on Pink Street is full of "
"collagen... Ladies like that, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Hmm... Kyushu No. 1 Star does tonkotsu ramen, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Yeah, that's right."
msgstr "Sì, esatto."

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Collagen, huh... Well, if it sounds cool, it must be good for you! Let's go "
"get some ramen sometime, okay? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"You know the Yoshida Batting Center? Pro baseball players go there to "
"practice sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Oooh! There are a ton of super hot guys playing professional baseball "
"lately, too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Yeah! Maybe we should go check it out sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"You heard about the Matcha Fair that Café Alps is having? It's that little "
"place over on Nakamichi Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"Ooh, that's the place with all the Japanese sweets, right? They're getting "
"pretty popular, huh? And their sweets look sooo good! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Why don't we go try them sometime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's a great idea! I can't wait to go with you. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Have you eaten the braised pork burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Raised pork burger? How do you raise pork?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"No, I said it's braised pork. They take pork, sear it, then cook it in a "
"kind of stew. Then they put it between two buns like a hamburger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Huh... I never knew that was a thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Wouldn't rice go better with that kind of pork, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"I heard you can make bag reservations at Le Marche over on Showa Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "Uh."

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Not your thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"I mean, I don't go shopping on my own, so I don't keep up with stuff like "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Whenever I want something, I just grab it, hop in line, and wait for someone"
" else to buy it for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Wait, didn't I tell you about this before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Yeah, you did..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of Tantakatan? It's a kind of shochu made with red "
"perilla."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Ooh, yeah! I've heard of it! It's super good, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Apparently it's easy to drink, and even better when you mix it with juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"Oh man, I know that from personal experience! I love drinking it with "
"cranberry juice. <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"It's so smooth, I end up chugging the whole drink in one go. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"Next time you're in Okinawa, try out the Okinawan Soba place at the "
"Kariyushi Arcade. Their rafute soba's supposed to be the best on the island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Rafute? Is that that stuff that's like braised pork, but Okinawan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"I think I heard about that on TV! They trim off all the extra fat, which "
"makes it way healthier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Huh. I'm surprised you knew about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Hehehe... I know a little bit of random trivia here and there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of a bar called Aqua Sky? It's all the way in Okinawa, "
"over at Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "What? Why would I know about a specific bar all the way over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"Apparently, there's a really popular appetizer there. Can you guess what "
"that might be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"A popular appetizer... Well, since it's Okinawa, it's probably something "
"weird like tofuyo, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "It's actually just salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Wait... it's just salt? Like, table salt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid ""
"No, not just any old salt, but an especially rare one made only in Okinawa. "
"Not only is it salty, but it also has a sweetness to it... Helps bring out "
"the flavor of your drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Huh... Drinking with a side of salt... That's pretty dang classy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "You should try it sometime."
msgstr "Dovresti provarla qualche volta."

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "So, about Gelateria Kamuro..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "Are you gonna tell me how much you like gelato, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "No, I just..."
msgstr "No, io..."

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"You know, if you don't control yourself around gelato, you're gonna get fat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid ""
"Have you been to Sushi Gin on Showa Street yet? The place that Noboru "
"Kudarizaka visits..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid ""
"You're a big meanie, Kiryu-san, so I'm not gonna talk about this with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Uh, what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid ""
"I'll ask Kudarizaka-san about it in person the next time I'm at the studio!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "So there's this kimchi at Kanrai..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I looked it up. The cabbage gin is supposed to be really good for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "Cabbage... gin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid ""
"Yeah! That's what they give you on the side when you have yakiniku, right? "
"It must be some secret Korean recipe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid "...Wait, did you mean capsaicin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "Have you gone to Kyushu No. 1 Star yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid ""
"Yup! I got the tonkotsu ramen. The broth was so rich and\r\n"
"delicious! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "Did you notice anything different about your skin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"Yeah! It definitely got softer. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default> Isn't collagen "
"just awesome? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "Have you been by the Yoshida Batting Center by any chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Not yet. I've been too busy to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Oh, that's too bad."
msgstr "Oh, peccato."

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Have you been to the Matcha Fair at Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Not yet! I gotta go before it ends, though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "Sounds like a plan."
msgstr "Mi sembra un buon piano."

msgctxt "1384"
msgid ""
"It'll be your fault if I miss it, Kazuma Kiryu! You'd better apologize to me"
" if I do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "Did you end up trying the braised pork burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid ""
"No, but one of the other girls here had it. She said she's seeing it all "
"over the blogs she follows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid ""
"Maybe I should get in on it too. It could help my blog get more popular. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "Heh, that might be a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Le Marche has this reservation system..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
"I don't need a reservation, though. If I tell someone I want something, "
"they'll just buy it for me. It's that easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Right, you did say that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid "Have you tried Tantakatan yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid ""
"Of course I have! Heck, even our customers are super into it. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"Yeah! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> The reason it's so good is the red perilla "
"it's made from. It pairs perfectly with any kind of food, too! "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid ""
"I always end up chugging it instead of sipping it slowly. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "So. Let's talk rafute soba..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! I started craving it bad after the last time you talked about it, "
"so I went to the Okinawan restaurant near my place to try some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid ""
"It was sooo good, but I know I've gotta get myself to Okinawa if I want "
"something super authentic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid "Have I mentioned there's a really popular snack⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid "Yeah, you did. Okinawan salt, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid ""
"I can't get any around here, though. You should buy me some the next time "
"you're in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

